<p><strong>Pros:</strong> Stealth + proxies + CAPTCHA in one API, JavaScript rendering at no extra credit cost, failed calls refunded, credit-based pricing with no monthly minimum.</p>
<p><strong>Cons:</strong> Per-request cost, internet dependency, provider lock-in, no persistent sessions, logins, or natural-language control.</p>
